{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーいえばさ、\n言ってなかったんだけどさ、、、\n実はさ、、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21歳なんだよね、、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！エイプリルフール！\n17歳、伊藤純奈です！\n2年前くらいにもこの嘘ついた気がする！\nバリエーションの少なさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/04/01/8497495/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正午までしか嘘ついちゃいけないとか\n知らない！そんなのいや！短いわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/04/01/8497495/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、\n14thのお話！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のアンダー曲は「不等号」\nとってもかっこいい曲で純が\n好きな曲調です♡\nポジションはちはるさんとシンメ！\n歌では初めてハモりも挑戦したよ〜〜\nまひろさんと2人でサビだけ\nハモってるのでよーく聞いてみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、問題の個人PV。笑\nみんなびっくりさせてごめんね(´･_･`)笑\n初ホラー！ドッペルゲンガーのお話です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/04/01/8497495/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗くて見えないね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影はひたすら走ってたんだけど\n普段の走り方が究極にダサいから\n走り方を教えてもらったのーー\nだから多分ちゃんと走れてるはず！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影ほんと楽しくてまたホラー\nやってみたいなあ...って思った(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイプBに入ってるので\nみんな見てね〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/04/01/8497495/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織ちゃんに甘える純奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/04/01/8497495/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、お馴染み2期生会を\nしました(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/04/01/8497495/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"祝！3周年！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子琴子よねが用事で\n来れなかったんだけど、\nりさこななつんとは会えた♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は後輩も入ってくるので\n今まで以上に頑張らなくては！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4年目もよろしくお願いします！\nみんなだーーーいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/04/01/8497495/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎4月2日  別冊カドカワ\n橋本さんとの対談がのってます♡\nチェックしてね(・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nばいばーーーい！"}],"source":"archive"}